# twg installs its skills into ~/.claude/skills, which claude.nix points at this
# repo's skills/ — so its absolute symlinks into ~/.config/twg land here. Machine-local.
skills/twg
skills/twg-*
# leftovers from older skill syncs
skills/*.backup
